{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_016_03_i",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:45e1695765d3f05eb4bc8d5c282918f8670c96907c811ced6d1685d4a4d239f2",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_i:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:317229e91d6ba6c45fca0754c38138394d350a2ce70fd3adb92a0ba939ef01dc",
      "text": "几个月后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_i:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5df5af7a63075c56a87b0dcb2e64e87819b58fab712febba3e0f15055f7d2989",
      "text": "我在两位身上感受到了偶像的才能。\n请务必让我协助两位，将那份光芒传递给世界！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_i:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41292d5190924bc6e12402ccea11d6ce40bd79b3f51dc87aa6c11af9a9959cff",
      "text": "（……315 Production。是个听都没听过的\n事务所的发掘。这一次……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_i:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5355609b33e3398a7b3327aee84f78f7363e1d25410c0abb6b6e0868ba544548",
      "text": "（……“这一次”？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_i:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05f7ee309e22ee8174894861552875b693a1f02345ea17a0a8012d94901b0386",
      "text": "（同样的借口，我以前应该也用过吧。\n我到底打算把决断推迟到什么时候？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_i:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e81b17453b399cd643181ed84c312e1bf8fab9d206e7aaad7c7063572e48696f",
      "text": "是时候该做出回答了。\n一周之后，我一定会给你答复。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_i:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca1904ed0d15ce88283b9c18f3f936eda19fc7183edfe56b3f5db408826108fe",
      "text": "（……是否进入演艺圈。也就是说……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_i:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d90f37c75c8ba1ed669ef43d391f8cf33cd347843f37702f21aa786277e69a9a",
      "text": "（在父母与祖父母之间，我该选择哪一方的心愿）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_i:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e553d23cc1ddbf64cf2700d811d875061d3162c09a6d37d460fcc648359081cc",
      "text": "……虽然从来没有强求过，但父母\n是希望我能进入同一个业界的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_i:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e93411e4000315d6123a0dffa4c0c019091acfcd13f1d7c2774200c81be48f6",
      "text": "可是，祖父母……直到临终前，\n都还在叫我要为了自己而活。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_i:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35650d17d2f9e3067518132ce98cc958776f2811b06cb03b7e160e0dec28a5af",
      "text": "他们认为演艺圈，如果是“为了某人”的话就不该进入。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_i:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_i:cmd-000155:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_i:cmd-000165:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8cebf9b3a67049b617ddd3e9186e5fa6ac9c12715b4aab931cadc44093fcaf4",
      "text": "……征一郎先生。\n有一件事，我想跟您商量一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
